  "description": "Every ngspice testbench and testbench template shipped under sim/, together with the cold-start entry points (run_*.sh), corner libraries, runner preambles, `klt sim` request documents (including the row-2 negative control) and experiment READMEs a third party needs to run them -- the same file set the hand-rolled item-9 inventory carried before issue #199, so the conversion to `klt signoff --attest` loses no coverage. The declared cold start is the SG13CMOS5L PVT deck's own CI-weight preflight, which generates and syntax-checks one netlist per bench at mos_tt/27C without writing a records/ entry; it needs ngspice >= 46, the OSDI models sim/tools/build-osdi.sh builds, and both PDK variants under one PDK_ROOT. Shipped-and-runnable only: no measurement result is claimed here (items 5/6/8 own those).",
